  [PASS] K01.3 the ONE dimensionless number hbar contributes is the cosmological constant in Planck units (over 32 pi) -- i.e. the framework's only possible quantum statement IS the cosmological-constant problem, and it is a restatement of the first law, not new content.  This forecloses the whole 'a_0 meets quantum mechanics' class   (identity holds to 1e-12 on both footings)
    Lambda adds nothing at all: the first law fixes Lambda = 32 pi a_0^2/c^4, so (a_0, G, c, Lambda) is
