==============================================================================================================================
7. THE ONE SURVIVOR EXAMINED: T = sigma_T a_0/(G m_p), and the one physical bridge to a measured quantity
==============================================================================================================================
  T is dimensionless because a_0/G is a surface density and m_p/sigma_T is the electron-scattering column.
  The only physical argument that connects a_0 to the Thomson opacity is momentum-driven AGN feedback:
     King (2003):  M_BH = f_g kappa sigma^4 / (pi G^2)         [kappa = sigma_T/m_p, f_g the gas fraction]
     deep MOND  :  sigma^4 = (1/A) G M_b a_0                   [A the Faber-Jackson coefficient, model-dependent]
     =>  M_BH / M_b = (f_g / (pi A)) * T                       -- a_0 sets the BH-to-baryon mass fraction, and
         the relation is predicted to have slope EXACTLY 1 in log M_BH vs log M_b.
    canonical  A = 9/4 (Milgrom isothermal sphere)  f_g = Om_b/Om_m   M_BH/M_b = 1.239e-03
    canonical  A = 9/4 (Milgrom isothermal sphere)  f_g = 1           M_BH/M_b = 7.891e-03
    canonical  A = 4 (sigma = v_flat/sqrt2)         f_g = Om_b/Om_m   M_BH/M_b = 6.969e-04
    canonical  A = 4 (sigma = v_flat/sqrt2)         f_g = 1           M_BH/M_b = 4.439e-03
    alt        A = 9/4 (Milgrom isothermal sphere)  f_g = Om_b/Om_m   M_BH/M_b = 1.496e-03
    alt        A = 9/4 (Milgrom isothermal sphere)  f_g = 1           M_BH/M_b = 9.526e-03
    alt        A = 4 (sigma = v_flat/sqrt2)         f_g = Om_b/Om_m   M_BH/M_b = 8.413e-04
    alt        A = 4 (sigma = v_flat/sqrt2)         f_g = 1           M_BH/M_b = 5.359e-03
    measured (Kormendy & Ho 2013): M_BH/M_bulge = 3e-3 to 5e-3, with 0.3-0.5 dex scatter and a slope 1.17 +- 0.08
  VERDICT ON T, against interest: the SLOPE is a genuine zero-parameter prediction, but it is NOT discriminating
  -- LambdaCDM reaches the same slope through King + a Faber-Jackson exponent of 4, which it also has.  The
  AMPLITUDE is where a_0 lives, and it carries f_g and A, both effectively fitted, so criterion (2) fails.
  Recorded as the census's only survivor and as a LOW-promise candidate, not as a law.

==============================================================================================================================
VERDICT -- ANGLE 2, DONE PROPERLY RATHER THAN IMPRESSIONISTICALLY
==============================================================================================================================
  1. The enumeration TERMINATES, and that is the main result.  {a_0, G, c} is a complete basis, so there is
     exactly one a_0-natural value per dimension and the search space is the 14-row table in section 1, not an
     open field.  Lambda adds nothing (the first law), hbar adds exactly one number, and that number is the
     cosmological-constant problem -- so there is no unexplored 'a_0 meets quantum mechanics' territory at all.
  2. A THEOREM THAT EXPLAINS THE HUNT'S OWN BLOCKER: the a_0-natural luminosity c^5/G and force c^4/G contain
     no a_0.  No mass-to-light ratio can ever be predicted from a_0, G and c.  Every Upsilon result in the
     ledger is a ratio calibration; none is, or can be, a derivation.
  3. THE CENSUS IS A NULL.  Of 37 measured constants, the only ones within 2 dex of their a_0-natural value are
     the cosmological ones, which are restatements of a_0 = c H_Lambda / Z, plus ONE genuine survivor:
     T = sigma_T a_0/(G m_p) = 0.0558 (canonical) / 0.0673 (alt).  Everything else is 20 to 120 dex away.
  4. THE COINCIDENCES ARE FLAGGED AND LEFT.  sqrt(G m_e/a_0) lands 4% from the proton charge radius on the
     canonical footing and 13% away on the alt; (rho_DE)^(1/4) lands a factor 3.8 from the solar neutrino
     splitting.  Neither has a physical argument, both move with the footing, and the SM sector is walled.
  5. WHAT THE ANGLE DID NOT FIND: no second Kepler-grade law comes out of pure dimensional analysis, and the
     reason is structural rather than accidental -- a_0 is one number, the basis it completes is three-
     dimensional, and every dimensionless combination it makes with a measured constant is either the first
     law rewritten or astronomically far from unity.  The productive candidates must anchor on a measured
     ASTROPHYSICAL quantity with a physical argument, not on a constant of nature.

RESULT: 6 checks, 0 FAIL   rc=0
